  "title": "Sorghum, Quail Egg, Avocado, Kumato®and Buffalo Mozzarella Bowl",
  "description": "Sorghum is topped with quail eggs, avocado, Kumato® tomato, and buffalo mozzarella cheese in this gluten-free, vegetarian meal in a bowl.",
